1
00:00:00,200 --> 00:00:02,220
I'm going to trick your brain.

2
00:00:02,240 --> 00:00:04,680
Right in front of your eyes.

3
00:00:04,700 --> 00:00:06,620
Count every seagull you see.

4
00:00:06,710 --> 00:00:07,860
Only the birds.

5
00:00:08,030 --> 00:00:08,770
Ready?

6
00:00:08,790 --> 00:00:09,670
Go.

7
00:00:21,240 --> 00:00:22,460
How many?

8
00:00:22,630 --> 00:00:23,620
Nine?

9
00:00:23,890 --> 00:00:26,000
Now a different question.

10
00:00:26,450 --> 00:00:28,040
What color was the ship?

11
00:00:28,090 --> 00:00:30,280
At first, it was red.

12
00:00:30,610 --> 00:00:32,920
Then, without a single cut,

13
00:00:32,940 --> 00:00:35,320
it slowly turned blue.

14
00:00:35,370 --> 00:00:37,140
That's gradual change blindness.

15
00:00:37,160 --> 00:00:39,970
When your attention is locked on one task,

16
00:00:39,990 --> 00:00:42,820
slow changes elsewhere can slip past you.

17
00:00:42,870 --> 00:00:45,590
Think of a snack bag getting slightly smaller,

18
00:00:45,610 --> 00:00:48,770
or changes in routines you hardly notice.

19
00:00:49,220 --> 00:00:51,440
Your brain isn't recording every detail.

20
00:00:51,600 --> 00:00:54,280
It prioritizes what matters right now.

21
00:00:54,330 --> 00:00:56,430
And if you spotted the color?

22
00:00:56,450 --> 00:00:57,450
Nice catch.

23
00:00:57,610 --> 00:00:58,590
Watch it again.

24
00:00:58,760 --> 00:01:00,640
How many seconds did it take you to

25
00:01:00,660 --> 00:01:01,440
notice?

